Me solte!

121
00:15:30,500 --> 00:15:31,800
Solte!

122
00:15:46,100 --> 00:15:47,100
Anda.

123
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:52,500
Anda!

124
00:16:15,300 --> 00:16:17,700
Anda!

125
00:16:17,900 --> 00:16:20,800
Anda! Anda!

126
