135
00:19:14,400 --> 00:19:16,100
Entendeu, ianque?

136
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:39,900
Obrigado.

137
00:20:11,100 --> 00:20:14,800
Obrigado...
Por tudo.

138
00:24:08,300 --> 00:24:09,800
Tem fogo?

139
00:24:38,100 --> 00:24:39,700
Abaixe-se paspalho.

140
00:24:46,200 --> 00:24:47,900
